herdr-mods
Mods for Herdr (https://herdr.dev).

Eight mods here are modified copies of mods shipped with herdr-app
(https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app, Apache License 2.0). Changed from upstream:
  dg-agents            <- agents
  dg-changes             <- changes
  dg-files               <- files
  dg-spaces            <- spaces
  dg-tabs             <- tabs
  dg-status-bar   <- workspace-status
  dg-workspace-chrome  <- workspace-chrome
  dg-new-menu          <- new-menu
Each of these carries changes from the upstream version; see its RECIPE.md.
The scheduling design of tools/tasks (the Tasks scheduler) is ported from
herdr-automations (MIT), https://github.com/DnzzL/herdr-automations; see tools/tasks/NOTICE.md.

dg-file-view's git diff view is partly adapted from herdr-powertools
(https://github.com/stefanoginella/herdr-powertools, packages/git-diff, Apache License 2.0,
Copyright 2026 Stefano Ginella). The diff modules dg-file-view/mods/dg-file-view/diff-model.js,
diff-words.js and git-guard.js are ported from its diff.js, words and git-guard files, and the
split, fold/expand and stage-hunk behaviour follows its main.js. Changes from upstream: hunkPatch
refuses mode changes, modes other than 100644/100755, and cut, binary or conflicted diffs, so a
patch only ever carries content edits; git-guard takes the expected checkout root in its expect
object; words takes a per-file budget and markTokens merges word marks into syntax tokens;
diff-layout.js (wrapping, unified and split layout, Auto) is written for this mod and is not from
upstream. Each ported file carries its own header naming what changed.
